@Catalog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:44339

### Create a new game
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Resident Evil X",
  "description": "A new chapter in the Resident Evil series, combining survival horror with intense action.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "release": "2026-12-01",
  "price": 79.99
}
###

### Get all games
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/
Accept: application/json
###

### Get a game by id
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/{id}
Accept: application/json
###

### Update a game
PUT {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/{id}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Resident Evil X - Remastered",
  "description": "Remastered edition with improved visuals and extra content.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "release": "2026-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "price": 69.99
}
###

### Delete a game
DELETE {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/game/{id}
Accept: application/json
###